Scope

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository: the NE parsing,
disassembly and lifting tools under tools/, the recompilation runtime under
runtime/ (including the generated segments.h and mem_layout.h, which are
declarations and an address table rather than lifted code), the build files,
and the documentation.

It does NOT and cannot cover El-Fish itself. The original executable, its
overlays, its TSXLIB extender and its data files are not distributed here, and
you need a legitimate copy of the game to use any of this. The lifted C -- the
121 segment files this repository used to track, and no longer does -- is a
derivative work of that binary. Regenerate it from your own copy with
tools/ne_lift.py.

El-Fish is the property of its respective owners (Maxis / AnimaTek). This
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by either.
